sequenceDiagram
  participant G as 遊戲頁
  participant H as useBetting
  participant S as storage.js
  participant T as contract.js
  participant W as MetaMask
  participant F as FairBet v3
  G->>H: quickPlay(注型, 參數, 注金)
  H->>W: 取得簽署者
  H->>S: savePendingBet（承諾、種子、salt）
  H->>T: placeBetOnChain(commit)
  T->>W: 請求簽署
  W->>F: placeBet
  F-->>T: BetPlaced(betId, revealBlock)
  H->>S: updatePendingBet(betId, revealBlock)
  H->>T: waitForBlock(revealBlock)
  H->>T: settleBetOnChain(betId, seed, salt)
  T->>W: 請求簽署
  W->>F: settleBet
  F-->>T: BetSettled(結果, 熵, finalRandom, 賠付)
  Note over H: resolveBet() 本地重算並比對
  H->>S: removePendingBet
  G->>S: saveGame（完整紀錄）
